{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02546","headline":"奉和秋日即目应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和秋日即目应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉露交珠网，金风度绮钱。\n昆明秋景淡，岐岫落霞然。\n辞燕归寒海，来鸿出远天。\n叶动罗帷扬，花映绣裳鲜。\n规空升闇魄，笼野散轻烟。\n鹊度林光起，凫没水文圆。\n无机络秋纬，如管奏寒蝉。\n乃睠情何极，宸襟豫有旃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}